    <message id="dailybriefing_item_board_high_text">The club’s management views your current work positively.</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_fans_low_title">The mood among the fans is turning</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_fans_low_text">The fans expect visible signals: good results, clear communication or a sporting response.</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_fans_high_title">The fans are behind you</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_fans_high_text">The mood around the club is very positive. This can support home performances and sponsor impact.</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_media_high_title">High media pressure</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_media_high_text">The media expect a response. An open interview or a clear sporting signal may help.</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_chemistry_low_title">The dressing room needs stability</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_chemistry_low_text">Team chemistry is low. Training, the line-up and clearly defined roles should be reviewed.</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_chemistry_high_title">The squad looks united</message>
    <message id="dailybriefing_item_chemistry_high_text">Team chemistry is strong. The dressing-room environment supports sporting development.</message>

